{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>קשבת</b> — a verbal noun on the pattern of עורת." "<b>יומם ולילה</b> — joined with 'pray.' The sense: 'I pray today,' and 'I pray day and night many times.' 'Regarding the children of Israel, may You hear my prayer,' or [the meaning is] the entire day." "And the sense of יומם ולילה — for day together with night is called יום."], :book :nehemiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nehemiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nechemya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:58.525436477Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}